cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BioSilo in your research, please cite it as below."
title: BioSilo
abstract: >-
  Naturally partitioned biomedical datasets for federated learning. Each client
  is a real data-collection unit such as a hospital, imaging institution, or
  sequencing study, so client boundaries and the differences between them come
  from how the data was collected rather than from an artificial split.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mueller
    given-names: Brianna
repository-code: "https://github.com/briannamueller/BioSilo"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.1
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - biomedical data
  - benchmark datasets
  - healthcare
